<title>PORTUGAL: D.Telekom IPO should not hurt M3 - Tietmeyer.</title>
<headline>D.Telekom IPO should not hurt M3 - Tietmeyer.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The flotation of Deutsche Telekom was not expected to have any adverse affect on the German M-3 monetary aggregate, Bundesbank chairman Hans Tietmeyer said.</p>
<p>&quot;No, I don't see that,&quot; he told journalists when asked if the flotation would distort M-3.</p>
<p>Tietmeyer is in Portugal to attend celebrations marking the 150th anniversary of the Bank of Portugal.</p>
<p>-- Lisbon newsroom +351-1-3538254</p>
